These files are frozen copies of the 3.x (dbrrg) release in the field, taken
byte for byte from commit 53d72c1 on main:

  dbrrg-lib.sh        overlay/usr/lib/dracut/modules.d/90dbrrg/dbrrg-lib.sh
  dbrrg-ssh-hostkeys  overlay/usr/bin/dbrrg-ssh-hostkeys
  dbrrg-password      overlay/usr/bin/dbrrg-password
  dbrrg-save-home     overlay/usr/bin/dbrrg-save-home

They stand in for the previous release on the stick (tl.old/), which a 4.0
home must still work under. test/integration/test-3x-fallback.sh runs them.
Do not rename them, do not edit them, and leave them out of any rename of
dbrrg to thinfloe: they are the old names on purpose.
